<title>USA: Odetics unit wins Sun contract.</title>
<headline>Odetics unit wins Sun contract.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>ATL Products Inc, a unit of Odetics Inc, on Wednesday said it will provide library storage products for Sun Microsystems Inc computer products.</p>
<p>ATL initially will supply its DLT automated libraries for Sun's Enterprise Tape Library 4/1000. Also, the companies will jointly develop Sun library management software.</p>
<p>Odetics' class A shares were up 3/4 at 21 by mid-afternoon.</p>
